过智能合约提现10,390,000 USDC，经CoW Swap兑换5,760 ETH后转移至Hyperliquid平台（ChainCatcher/PANews）。Abraxas Capital相关地址24小时内账户价值减少1.5亿美元，空头仓位缩至约7000万美元（Unchained/ChainCatcher）。Lighter已暂停提款及资金池创建，并追回约500万美元USDC，新增钱包签名验证机制（The Defiant）。","latest":"Lighter宣布恢复提款并新增钱包签名要求","cover":null},{"rank":3,"story":{"publicId":"72611f63-8c72-43b8-b5f1-6fad80817954","title":"Saylor策略公司增持比特币并回购股票应对MSCI规则调整和市场暴跌"},"heat":31.2,"trend":"down","trendPct":-15.8,"badges":[],"participantCount":4,"sourceCount":4,"sourceNames":["Unchained","Decrypt","The Block","PANews"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/03ab07c950800a2f0f7d53b864faeb17d5b0902b04887c3fe43b9eb83178915c.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/d3547b0702d576d9fb6ec4be5c6417de1dabfad729dbabaa59823134a3d71581.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/03ab07c950800a2f0f7d53b864faeb17d5b0902b04887c3fe43b9eb83178915c.webp 96w","name":"The Block","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","name":"PANews","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/fa45a4b0d924ec2c790ec5c529735ada5876ee1d2094a91834e0ce1ca7df006d.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/1b4d6e1a262b9aeb3b737456d54ad7154cc6e47aea321b5cd3f31dea6c37fa6f.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/fa45a4b0d924ec2c790ec5c529735ada5876ee1d2094a91834e0ce1ca7df006d.webp 96w","name":"Unchained","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/a192c125ac7c90e5e5369c2f6b25b235e5783c7c265d2b663f70de4fcda2fd35.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp 96w","name":"Decrypt","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,9.3,34,null,null,null],"summary":"Saylor策略公司于2026年11月15日增持485枚比特币（价值约3340万美元）并回购2.28亿美元股票，总比特币持仓增至850,849枚，以对冲市场暴跌和MSCI规则调整风险【新】\n\n公司自2020年起持续增持比特币，当前持仓规模为市场第四大。根据MSCI规则调整，成分股市值占比低于15%或营收占比低于10%的企业需从相关指数剔除，Saylor因比特币持仓占比过高面临潜在风险【新】【旧】\n\n具体操作中，公司通过出售股票获得24.47亿美元资金，其中2.06亿美元用于回购优先股，3340万美元用于购入比特币（均价75,452美元/枚含手续费），剩余500万美元留存现金。比特币持仓均价为75,452美元/枚，较增持前下跌42%（同期股价下跌28%）【新】","latest":"Strategy公司以3340万美元购入485枚比特币，总持仓增至850,849枚","cover":null},{"rank":4,"story":{"publicId":"2fd808a3-75fa-4cfe-a37b-57fa5a7510d4","title":"美国商务部发布AI芯片远程访问限制新规引市场波动"},"heat":30,"trend":"down","trendPct":-16,"badges":[],"participantCount":4,"sourceCount":4,"sourceNames":["MarketWatch Top Stories","The Defiant","PANews","链捕手 ChainCatcher"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","name":"PANews","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278efd303d2c0fa89607.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/225c8aa97260f72481bf08fcda803749fcb72936e521407b941da6d427a4e11e.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/21583c6886c21bce1927f3d59a85dcf7d3c978aafe60278